    <briefdescription>
<para>Time-of-week window during which updates are allowed. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Time values use 24-hour &quot;HH:MM&quot; format. Days are matched case-insensitively against: &quot;Monday&quot;, &quot;Tuesday&quot;, &quot;Wednesday&quot;, &quot;Thursday&quot;, &quot;Friday&quot;, &quot;Saturday&quot;, &quot;Sunday&quot;, and the special token &quot;Daily&quot; (which matches every day of the week). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
